title Bylaws of Knowbooks Inc.
corporation Knowbooks Inc.
state Hawaii
effective 2026-08-01

bylaws
 directors
  one or more
  elected by shareholders
  may act by unanimous written consent
  quorum majority of directors in office
 officers
  President and Chief Executive Officer
  Vice President and Treasurer
  one person may hold multiple offices
  serve at pleasure of Board
 shares
  authorized 1000000 common
  may be issued subject to vesting or restrictions approved by Board
 meetings
  may be held in or outside Hawaii
  in person or by any means all can hear each other
  action may be taken by unanimous written consent
  opening
   a Norm Macdonald video must be played at the beginning of each board meeting
  attire
   everyone must wear sunglasses
 amendments
  by Board of Directors
 publication
  all minutes and bylaws shall be written in Scroll
  committed to public Git
  published on the World Wide Web and/or World Wide Scroll